ie qian fu he is an orphan adopted by  a short-tempered eccentric kung fu  teacher named lee lee profits by  scamming innocent students promising to  be a kung fu expert when his skills are  merely average he frequently abuses  chien foo physically and makes him do  all the cleaning jian fu wants to learn  to fight but even though he works in a  kung fu school he is never given the  opportunity to train one morning lee is  resting while the students practice as  usual shinfu watches them and tries  mimicking their movements forgetting to  sweep the floor lee notices and hits him  with a stick to trouble the kid even  more he walks around with white powder  under his shoes which means he has to  sweep the floor twice later lee uses  shan fu as a prop to teach his students  a new form of fighting he orders qian fu  to not dodge the attacks and beats him  up as an example this is not the first  time he has used qianfu to make himself  look like a kung fu expert cianfu is  frequently beaten up but he has no other  way to make a living the only person who  sympathizes with him is the school's  cook and even offers to apply medicine  to his wounds somewhere else pay ends up  in front of another kung fu school in  the town and decides to take a rest  inside a wealthy businessman and his  overweight son lap ban have come to  check if the school is good enough for  lap band's admission the head teacher  boasts about his trainees being the best  in town but lap band is not convinced he  asks a student to break a stack of three  bricks with a single blow the student  does as told and manages to break them  all but as soon as he is out of lap  band's sight he yells in pain while  holding his hand that is now starting to  turn blue moments later lap band tries  to shake his hand and realizes that he  was only pretending to be tough the  father and son leave to get admission to  lee's school instead after that the  students see pay resting outside and  take their frustration out 