ay  he is lazily sweeping the floor in the  school when lee sees him and decides to  trouble him as always he steps on white  powder but before he can step on the  floor shinfu slides them off under his  feet lee tries his best to trick jianfu  but he is quicker because of the  training as they are struggling a group  from the rival school barges in the  leader of the group is the new three  province's champ in kung fu he is  furious because all other schools in the  town sent him gifts to show respect but  lee didn't do so hence he challenges lee  and his fellow teacher to a match lee is  reluctant but since all his students are  watching he has no choice but to accept  the state champion doesn't waste time  before beating them both up proving that  they are just a bunch of frauds who only  know basic knowledge about kung fu jian  fu wants to help them but since he has  promised pay that he will only use his  skills for defense he stays out of the  fight after the two are defeated the  students follow the state champion to  the rival school later that day cianfu  is cleaning when the former teacher of  the school master hang returns from a  trip he used to be the head teacher  until lee took over enraged that they  were defeated by the opponents he walks  to the rival school and challenges the  state champion they get into an intense  fight both matched in skills but in the  end the state champion beats master hang  and doesn't stop attacking him chinfu  finally steps in which angers the  champion even more he attacks him a  couple of times asking him to fight back  now that shienfu can use his training as  defense he doesn't hold back and starts  battling him everyone is shocked to see  that a mere janitor is giving the state  champion a hard time master hang is just  as surprised because he didn't know  cianfu could fight from the entrance  door shang kwan is also watching them he  sees cianfu's technique and recognizes  it as the snake fist technique since  only one person from the clan is still  alive he is sure that shin fu knows pay  after defeating the champion qian fu and  hang return to their school at home  cianfu finds a letter by pay that says  he will be gone for a few days alongside  the letter is a book on snake style  fighting cianfu rushes to the shed to  see pay but the old man has already left  just then shang kwan who has been  tailing him until now inquires if he  knows pay when chienfu confirms shang  kwan lies about being pai's friend and  asks shan fu to tell him when he returns  from his trip he also emphasizes to keep  his arrival a secret from pay because he  wants to surprise his old friend a naive  cianfu believes him and agrees to help  him upon reaching home he sees his pet  cat fighting a snake even though at  first glance the snake looks more  dangerous it is proven to be weak  against the cat's paws this gives cianfu  an idea to mix the paw technique with  the snake fest technique to make it more  dangerous somewhere else pay returns to  the town and is immediately confronted  by su chen at first su chen pretends to  be dead and then attacks him with a  knife he believes pay was stabbed but  turns out he was ready to dodge the  attack they get into a fight where pay  overpowers him with his expertise and  kills him following that he goes to meet  chien foo who is overjoyed to have him  back they ask the cook for tea but the  man mixes poison into it just then  chianfoo remembers shenquan and rushes  to tell him about pay's arrival but when  they return looking for him pay has  already fled shanghuan predicts where he  is heading and runs after him as chien  follows them on his way cianfu is  stopped by the russian missionary who  wants to kill him they get into a fight  where the missionary has an upper hand  because of his sword cianfu gets his  clothes torn but still manages to defeat  him in the end somewhere else pay meets  shenkwon he has had enough of running  and wants to fight to put 